# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000221> (is quality measurement of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000221> "m is a quality measurement of q at t. When q is a quality, there is a measurement process p that has specified output m, a measurement datum, that is about q"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000221> "is quality measurement of"@en)
