AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> "a relation between a specifically dependent continuant (the characteristic) and any other entity (the bearer), in which the characteristic depends on the bearer for its existence."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000052> "characteristic of"@en)

# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000056> (participates in)

