# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000367> (light emission function)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000367> "A light emission function is an excitation function to excite a material to a specific excitation state that it emits light."@en)
