SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000384> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000391>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000391> (energy supply function)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000391> "An energy supply function is a function to supply or transfer energy from an energy source to a consumer of the energy"@en)
